{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p013b","title":"孔融劝祢衡见曹操祢衡骂营门曹操遣骑送刘表","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p013b-account","label":"张衡《文士传》","text":"孔融劝祢衡见曹操祢衡骂营门曹操遣骑送刘表","evidence":["xunyu-e-p013b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0155","role":"劝见","evidence":["xunyu-e-p013b-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0026","role":"骂曹被送","evidence":["xunyu-e-p013b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣送","evidence":["xunyu-e-p013b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"祢衡在许都时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-p013b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-p013b-q","source_order":[10,82,"P013b"],"order":2415}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0155","name":"孔融","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xunyu-p0026","name":"祢衡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p013b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-3e2135952faf7548507a","layer":"pei","quote":"融遂责数衡，并宣太祖意，欲令与太祖相见。衡许之，曰：‘当为卿往。’至十月，朝，融先见太祖，说‘衡欲求见’。至日晏，衡著布单衣，疏巾（履），坐太祖营门外；以杖捶地，数骂太祖。太祖敕外厩：急具精马三匹，并骑二人。谓融曰：‘祢衡竖子，乃敢尔！孤杀之无异于雀鼠！顾此人素有虚名，远近所闻；今日杀之，人将谓孤不能容。今送与刘表，视卒当何如？’乃令骑以衡置马上，两骑扶送至南阳。","attribution":"张衡《文士传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c5cdbaf6b01ad416ab88","start":221,"end":404}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
